<section xml:id="sec-quadratic-equations-completing" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Quadratic equations: completing the square</title>

	<objectives>
		<introduction>
			<p>
				In this section, we learn how to:
			</p>
		</introduction>
		<ol>
			<li><p>.</p></li>
			<li><p>.</p></li>
